					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Is&#8230; is that a picture of yourself or someone you know? If so, I would not recommend putting an image like that in public unless you fully understand what that entails, particularly the wiki.</p> <p>Any image that is posted on the wiki would end up being released into Creative Commons, allowing other people to use that image without having to consult you first.</p> 
				 	]]>
